### 测试 Camunda API 支持的参数格式

@baseUrl = http://192.168.109.66:31000
@auth = Basic ZGVtbzpkZW1v
@operateUrl = http://192.168.109.66:30000
@grpcUrl = http://192.168.109.66:31500

### 1. 测试 Zeebe Gateway HTTP 接口（JSON over HTTP）
POST {{grpcUrl}}/v2/process-instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bpmnProcessId": "genRepPdf",
  "version": 1,
  "variables": {
    "test": "value"
  }
}

### 2. 测试 Zeebe Gateway - 使用 processDefinitionKey
POST {{grpcUrl}}/v2/process-instances
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processDefinitionKey": 2251799813688573,
  "variables": {
    "test": "value"
  }
}

### 3. 测试 Operate UI 根路径
GET {{operateUrl}}/
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 2. 测试 Operate 的 API - v2/process-definitions
GET {{operateUrl}}/v2/process-definitions
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 3. 测试 Operate 的 API - /process-definitions
GET {{operateUrl}}/process-definitions
Authorization: {{auth}}

### 4. 测试 Zeebe Gateway /actuator/health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Authorization: {{auth}}

